spacefm (1.0.6+reaper7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Update Korean translation from upstream PR #804.
  * Update Russian translation from upstream PR #741.
  * Include aft-mtp-mount support for MTP mounts from upstream PR #757.
  * New maintained SpaceFM package based on upstream 1.0.6.
  * Include crash fix for unmounting volumes.
  * Include C23/compiler compatibility fixes.
  * Include sys/sysmacros.h for major()/minor() declarations on modern Linux.
  * Include GCC 10.1+ build fixes from upstream PR #772.
  * Include Btrfs clone ioctl support from upstream PR #640.
  * Build-depend on libbtrfs-dev so Btrfs clone support is enabled.
  * Include dash-compatible configure fixes from upstream PR #813.
  * Include reviewed GCC 14 build fixes from upstream PR #816.
  * Include activation fix for selected items without focus from upstream PR #749.
  * Include parent navigation on empty-area double-click inspired by upstream PR #699.
  * Build GTK2 interface with libudev, startup notification, desktop integration,
    and video thumbnail support enabled.
  * Add -fcommon build flag for compatibility with legacy global
    definitions under modern GCC.

